@* Partial: _OrderDetailsPartial.cshtml
   Built from the scanned order screen. Uses the same grid / field / pair markup as the GR/LC partial.
   Struck-out fields on the scan (OBA/NA, MR Name, Age Grp) are intentionally left out.
   Add these helpers once to your shared CSS if you don't have them:
     .grid.cols-6 .span-2 { grid-column: span 2; }
     .grid.cols-6 .span-3 { grid-column: span 3; }
     .grid.cols-6 .span-6 { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
     .form-section { margin: 1.25rem 0 .5rem; font-weight: 600; }
*@

